# Autarch Mammoth, {4}{G}{G} 5/5, Saddle 5: "When this creature enters and whenever it attacks while saddled, create a 3/3 green Elephant."
# Turn 1: cast off the Lotus and three Moxen; entering makes one Elephant (power 3, summoning sick). Saddle 5 is refused with the Elephant alone
# (3 power). Turn 3: with the Elephant and a Llanowar Elves (3 + 1 = 4) it is still refused; Grizzly Bears (2) and the Elephant (3) together pay Saddle 5, the Mammoth attacks saddled and a second Elephant is created
# (Bot2 takes 5, at 15). Turn 5: it attacks unsaddled (the saddling ended with turn 3): no third Elephant, Bot2 at 10.

